From: forkmesh <forkmesh@users.forkmesh.local>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 13:39:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/80] Avatar links to profile; edit username in profile
 settings

Point the header avatar at /dashboard/profile instead of /dashboard/settings
so clicking it opens the user's profile page.

Move the node-name (username) rename control out of the Account settings
section and into the Public profile section's Name field, relabelled
'Username', with its own current-password field so the change can be
completed in place. The Account section now links to Public profile.

Rebuilt the composed dashboard assets from the edited partials/JS fragments.

