PullStore::createPull pumps the GUI event loop while waiting on git
(waitForFinishedKeepAlive), and a reloadAgents() fired during the pump
rebuilds m_agentSessions — so the AgentSession& held by
landAgentPullForSession dangled, and session.prNumber = pr /
saveSession(session) then read freed memory (crash in repoKey's
QString+QString). Git-pump UAF family, same fix as adhoc #106/#119/#124:
take the session by value and re-find the live entry by id to stamp
prNumber so a re-fired finished pass can't open a duplicate PR.

