- buildAndPreviewCurrentPull: copy head/number out of the PR before the
  rev-parse pump.
- sendCurrentPullToSource: copy the PullRequest and RepositoryRecord to
  values before the modal confirm's nested event loop.
- promptNewPullFromSource: take the repo record by value; the localPath
  write-back now goes through the index explicitly.

